@NODE iNTRODUCTiON "iNTRODUCTiON OF iGDMEA VERSiON 1.3"

iCH GEB DiR MAL EBEN ACCESS VERSiON 1.3 iS A SECURiTY DOOR FOR ACCOUNT-
EDiTiNG. iT HAS @{"FEATURES" LiNK FEATURES} THAT MAKE YOUR SYSTEM MUCH MORE SAFE.

@ENDNODE

@NODE FEATURES "FEATURES OF iGDMEA VERSiON 1.3"

WELL, iGDMEA WORKS KiNDA SiMPLE. EVERYBODY HAS TO ENTER A SPECiAL PASSWORD
TO EDiT ACCOUNTS. THEN THE DOOR CHECKS iF THE USER HAS REALLY ACCESS TO
ACCOUNT EDiTiNG OR NOT. iF NOT (ONLY HE HAS THE SECURiTY LEVEL TO START
THE DOOR - MAYBE A HACKER) THE DOOR WiLL MAKE AN ENTRY iNTO THE CALLERSLOG
AND WiLL ALERT THE SYSOP BY FLASHiNG THE SCREEN AND MAKE SOME BEEPS.

i THiNK THAT iS MUCH SAFER iN TiMES EVERYBODY FEARS TO GET BUSTED.

AND NOW i THiNK i GAVE YOU ENOUGH REASONS TO iNSTALL iGDMEA VERSiON 1.3. :)

@ENDNODE

@NODE iNSTALLATiON "iNSTALLATiON OF iGDMEA VERSiON 1.3"

iNSTALLATiON TO @{"AMi EXPRESS V2.xx" LiNK AMiEXPRESSV2.xx}.

iNSTALLATiON TO @{"AMi EXPRESS V3.xx" LiNK AMiEXPRESSV3.xx}.

@ENDNODE

@NODE AMiEXPRESSV2.xx "iNSTALLATiON TO AMi EXPRESS V2.xx"

TO iNSTALL THE DOOR LOAD UP THE CUSTOMCOMMANDS (/X V2.2x OR BELOW) OR
BBS.CMD (/X V2.3x) AND ADD THE FOLLOWiNG LiNE TO THE LiST.


          11 SPACES iN         
          |
---------------------------------------------          
*1        RM255MODULES:MM_TOOLS/ACCESS/ACCESS
---------------------------------------------
||        |||  |           
||        |||  ` 'MODULES:MM_TOOLS/ACCESS/ACCESS' iS THE LOCATiON OF
||        |||     THE FiLE.
||        |||
||        ||` 255 THE MiNiMUM ACCESS TO USE THiS DOOR. CHANGE iT TO WHAT
||        ||      YOU LiKE.
||        ||
||        |` 'M' FOR A MULTiNODE BBS ('S' FOR A SiNGLE NODE BBS).
||        |
||        ` 'R' FOR A REXX DOOR WHiCH WiLL USE THE 'REXXDOOR'-UTiL.
||
|`COMMAND TO START THE DOOR.
|
`-RETARD OPTiON. TO MAKE SURE THEY ONLY USE '1' & ONLY  '1' TO GET THE
  DOOR TO COME UP. iF NOT USED, THiNGS SUCH AS '12345' AND '1Z' WOULD
  STiLL BRiNG UP THE DOOR.


  USE THE LiNE BETWEEN THE LiNES ONLY. THE OTHER PARTS ARE JUST AN
  EXPLANATiON TO MAKE SURE YOU KNOW WHAT EACH PART iS DOiNG (SiNCE
  NOONE WOULD TELL ME BACK iN THE DAYS WHERE i DiDN'T KNOW WHAT WAS
  GOiNG ON!)  

  NOW COPY THE DiRECTORY 'MODULES' FROM THE LHA-ARCHiEV TO YOUR BBS.

  THEN COPY THE 'DODELAY'-COMMAND FROM THE C-DiRECTORY OF THE
  LHA-ARCHiEVE iNTO YOUR C-DiRECTORY.

  AT LAST EDiT THE @{"TOOLTYPES" LiNK TOOLTYPES} OF THE 'ACCESS.iNFO'.
  YOU FiND iT iN 'BBS:MODULES/MM_TOOLS/ACCESS'.

  NOTE!

  MAKE SURE YOU HAVE THE FOLLOWING COMMANDS IN YOUR C-DIRECTORY:

  1. COPY
  2. DELETE

  IF YOU DON'T HAVE THE COMMANDS IN YOUR C-DIRECTORY iGDMEA 1.3 WiLL
  NOT WORK CORRECTLY.

@ENDNODE

@NODE AMiEXPRESSV3.xx "iNSTALLATiON TO AMi EXPRESS V3.xx"

THE ONLY THiNG TO DO iS TO COPY THE FiLES FROM THE LHA-ARCHiEVE TO YOUR BBS. THEN
EDiT THE @{"TOOLTYPES" LiNK TOOLTYPES} iN THE 'ACCESS.iNFO'.
YOU WiLL FiND iT iN 'BBS:MODULES/MM_TOOLS/ACCESS/'.

AT LAST COPY THE 'DODELAY'-COMMAND FROM THE C-DiRECTORY OF THE
LHA-ARCHiEVE iNTO YOUR C-DiRECTORY.

  NOTE!

  MAKE SURE YOU HAVE THE FOLLOWING COMMANDS IN YOUR C-DIRECTORY:

  1. COPY
  2. DELETE

  IF YOU DON'T HAVE THE COMMANDS IN YOUR C-DIRECTORY iGDMEA 1.3 WiLL
  NOT WORK CORRECTLY.

@ENDNODE

@NODE TOOLTYPES "HOW TO EDiT THE TOOLTYPES?"

 PASSWORD=<pw>

 <pw> iS THE PASSWORD WHiCH WiLL BE USED TO GET iNTO ACCOUNT-EDITING.


 PWLENGTH=<num>

 <num> iS THE NUMBER OF CHARACTERS THE PASSWORD HAS. IF YOU USE 'SUXX'
 AS A PASSWORD, <num> HAS A VALUE OF 4 (FOUR).

 !!! NEVER USE A PASSWORD THAT HAS MORE THAN 9 CHARACTERS !!!


 USER.<num>=<name>

 <num> iS THE NUMBER OF THE USER WHO HAS ACCESS TO ACCOUNT-EDiTiNG.
 THE FiRST USER HAS a <num>-VALUE OF '01', THE SECOND USER HAS A
 <num>-VALUE OF '02' AND SO ON.


THAT SHOULD BE ENOUGH FOR NOW.....

@ENDNODE       

